Upstream-derived files that were modified (per AGPL-3.0 section 5):

  * models.py                          - added RVC-style lightweight generator
                                         (SynthesizerTrnRvc) and RVC-Flow variant
                                         (SynthesizerTrnRvcFlow, A1/A2), arch_name tags
  * train.py                           - CPU training support, max_steps/auto_stop,
                                         validation-loss logging, arch selection,
                                         discriminator LR scaling, RVC-Flow KL handling
  * train_diff.py                      - config handling adjustments
  * inference/infer_tool.py            - diffusion config existence check fix, arch-aware
                                         model loading, torch.compile, retrieval mmap,
                                         cluster file format auto-detection (faiss/kmeans)
  * utils.py                           - encoding / compatibility fixes, checkpoint
                                         architecture validation (save/load arch tag)
  * preprocess_flist_config.py         - encoding fixes
  * preprocess_hubert_f0.py            - encoding fixes, F0 median smoothing,
                                         low-energy-frame unvoiced enhancement
  * diffusion/data_loaders.py          - encoding fixes
  * diffusion/logger/saver.py          - encoding fixes
  * diffusion/logger/utils.py          - encoding fixes
  * cluster/train_cluster.py           - encoding fixes
  * configs_template/config_template.json      - project defaults (arch / d_lr_scale / num_workers)
  * configs_template/diffusion_template.yaml   - project defaults
  * requirements.txt                   - dependency pins/mirror adjustments
  * .gitignore / .gitattributes / README.md    - project configuration/docs

